          "orig": "If a Transport model is destroyed, any units embarked within that Transport model must immediately disembark (see opposite) before that Transport model is removed from the battlefield.",
          "text": "If a Transport model is destroyed, any units embarked within that Transport model must immediately disembark (see opposite) before that Transport model is removed from the battlefield."
