            }
          ],
          "orig": "Units that disembark from a destroyed Transport model are not affected by that model's Deadly Demise ability (pg 23). Instead, you must roll one D6 for each disembarking model. For each roll of 1, that disembarking model's unit suffers 1 mortal wound (pg 23). In addition, if a unit disembarks from a destroyed Transport model:",
